      "text": "AND PLACE IT IN A LIQUOR PREPARED AS FOLLOWS: PUT IN THE MORTAR {{ing_02|50 GRAINS OF PEPPER}}, AS MUCH {{ing_03|HONEY}} [2] AS IS REQUIRED, {{ing_04|3 DRY ONIONS}}, {{ing_05|A LITTLE GREEN OR DRY CORIANDER}}, {{ing_06|A PINT OF BROTH}}, {{ing_07|1 SEXTARIUS OF OIL}}, {{ing_08|1 PINT OF WATER}}."
