      "step": 4,
      "text": "PLACE {{ing_01|THE PIG}} IN IT."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "WHEN IT COMMENCES TO BOIL, STIR THE GRAVY QUITE FREQUENTLY SO AS TO THICKEN IT."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "text": "SHOULD {{ing_06|THE BROTH}} THUS BE REDUCED [by evaporation] ADD {{ing_08|ANOTHER PINT OF WATER}}."
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "text": "IN THIS MANNER COOK [braise] {{ing_01|THE PIG}} TO PERFECTION AND SERVE IT."
